:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUGRP.Commands
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD ?ADDRDBDIRE'.Add RDB Directory Entry  ADDRDBDIRE
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD ?CHGRDBDIRE'.Change RDB Directory Entry  CHGRDBDIRE
